      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rickjonzz/{size}/1934_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-08-29T16:34:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That matches up with my experience. I was able to run part 1 and got to the final fight in part 2 (I just sort of handwaved the boss fight because we had to wrap up) in just over 3 hours with my regular group (who were very familiar with the lore and picked up on how the system works pretty quickly).&nbsp; However, this was explicitly a playtest so the roleplaying was pretty minimal. When I ran those two issues again at a con, I did it in 4 hours with 4 players who didn't know the lore as well and took longer to pick up the rules, but since there were fewer people, it ran faster.&nbsp;</p>",
